  - m_Id: 6593451503116293
    m_Localized: Speed Bonus
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6593451503116294
    m_Localized: Danger Zone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6593451503116295
    m_Localized: Trade Hub
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6593451503116296
    m_Localized: Port Access
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6593451503116297
    m_Localized: "Heart of the Celestial Empire \u2014 the great capital of the Ming
      dynasty. The finest goods and immeasurable riches are gathered here."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6593451503116298
    m_Localized: An ancient city at the start of the Silk Road. For centuries caravans
      departed westward from here across the endless steppes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6593451503116299
    m_Localized: A frontier city at the edge of the desert. Merchants prepare here
      for the perilous crossing through waterless lands.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6593451503116300
    m_Localized: A growing port on the coast. Sea junks and river boats bring goods
      here from across southern China.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6593451503116301
    m_Localized: "Pearl of the south \u2014 a city of craftsmen and weavers. Silk
      and tea from Hangzhou are renowned throughout the empire."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6593451503116302
    m_Localized: The greatest maritime port of Ming. Ships depart from here to Southeast
      Asia and distant Arabia.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6593451503116303
    m_Localized: "Southern gateway of China. The port connects the empire with overseas
      lands \u2014 from India to the Spice Islands."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6593451503116304
    m_Localized: Caravan speed +20%
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6593451503116305
    m_Localized: Bandit attacks possible
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6593451503116306
    m_Localized: "Improved trade conditions \u2014 more goods and better prices"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6593451503116307
    m_Localized: Maritime trade routes provide access to overseas goods
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
